━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ CubicRootsScalars is Tuple

+ root1 Coord
+ root2 Coord
+ root3 Coord
+ count I8

────────────────────
+ This
    - r1 Coord

= CubicRootsScalars(r1, 0, 0, 1)

────────────────────
+ This
    - r1 Coord
    - r2 Coord

= CubicRootsScalars(r1, r2, 0, 2)

────────────────────
+ This
    - r1 Coord
    - r2 Coord
    - r3 Coord

= CubicRootsScalars(r1, r2, r3, 3)

────────────────────
+ this[index Index]

|? index == 0
    root1
|? index == 1
    root2
|? index == 2
    root3
??
    -1

